<h2 class="text-center title">建立或編輯單招錄取資料與學生名冊</h2>
<hr>
<div class="row" id="form-enrollment-data-and-student-list">
	<div class="col-12">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">注意事項</div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p>
                    <strong class="text-danger">建立單招錄取資與學生清冊說明</strong>
                    <ol>
                        <li>
                            點擊“建立單招錄取資料”按鈕
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            填寫教育部、僑委會和錄取相關資料後點擊“建立資料”建立。
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            點擊“點擊編輯”按鈕
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            確認相關資料和上傳“教育部、僑委會和錄取”相關檔案
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            如有修改資料，請點擊“儲存資料”按鈕
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            如確認資料沒問題後，請點擊“送出資料”按鈕
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            如要刪除錄取資料，請點擊“刪除資料”（僅刪除錄取資料和錄取資料內的所有檔案，包含教育部、僑委會和錄取的所有檔案）
                        </li>
                    </ol>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong class="text-danger">其他注意事項</strong>
                    <ol>
                        <li>
                            建立“單招錄取資料”前，需先將單招通報資料送出資料
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            需上傳教育部、僑委會和錄取至少各一個檔案，並且送出的“單招通報資料”處理完成才能送出“單招錄取資料”
                        </li>
                    </ol>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <table class="table table-hover sortable" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>#</th>
                    <th>學年度</th>
                    <th>階段別</th>
                    <th>入學時間</th>
                    <th>通報次數</th>
                    <th>主旨</th>
                    <th>通報狀態</th>
                    <th>錄取名冊送件日期</th>
                    <th>錄取資料狀態與名冊</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="report-list">
            </tbody>
            <tfoot>
                <tr>
                    <th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th>
                </tr>
            </tfoot>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <table class="table table-hover">
                        <div id="pagination-container">
                        </div>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>
        </table>
        <div class="modal fade" id="enrollment-data-modal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="enrollment-data-title" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg" role="document">
                <div class="modal-content" id="modal-enrollment-data">
                    <div class="modal-header">
                        <h5 id="enrollment-data-modal-header"></h5>
                        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
                            <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal-body">
                        <!-- <div class=""> -->
                            <!-- <ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="myTab" role="tablist"> -->
                                <!-- <li class="nav-item" role="presentation"> -->
                                    <!-- <button class="nav-link active" id="tab1-tab" data-toggle="tab" data-target="#tab1" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="tab1" aria-selected="true"> -->
                                        <!-- 新增單一學生資料 -->
                                    <!-- </button> -->
                                <!-- </li> -->
                                <!-- <li class="nav-item" role="presentation"> -->
                                    <!-- <button class="nav-link" id="tab2-tab" data-toggle="tab" data-target="#tab2" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="tab2" aria-selected="false"> -->
                                        <!-- 上傳全部學生資料 -->
                                    <!-- </button> -->
                                <!-- </li> -->
                            <!-- </ul> -->
                        <!-- </div> -->
                        <div class="container-fluid">
                            <form>
                                <div class="card my-3" id="ministr-of-education-eligibility-approval-area">
                                    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                                        教育部
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <div class="row my-3">
                                            <div class="col-6">
                                                <label for="ministry-of-education-eligibility-approval-date">教育部資格審查日期</label>
                                                <input class="form-control input-datepicker" data-provide="datepicker" data-date-format="yyyy/mm/dd" id="ministry-of-education-eligibility-approval-date">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-6">
                                                <label>教育部資格審查文號</label>
                                                <input type="text" class="form-control" maxlength="191" id="ministry-of-education-eligibility-approval-doc-number">
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card hide my-3" id="upload-ministry-of-education-eligibility-file-area">
                                    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                                        教育部資格審查公文掃描檔
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <div class="alert alert-warning">
                                            可接受副檔名為 <strong class="text-danger">pdf、jpg、png</strong> 的檔案，單一個檔案大小需 <strong class="text-danger">小於 8 Mbytes</strong> 。
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="row btn-upload" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                                            <div class="col-12">
                                                <input type="file" class="filestyle upload-ministry-of-education-eligibility-file-btn" id="upload-ministry-of-education-eligibility-file-btn"
                                                    data-id="ministry-of-education-eligibility-file"
                                                    data-btnClass="btn-success"
                                                    data-input="false"
                                                    data-text=" 選取檔案"
                                                    data-Icon="<i class='fa fa-folder-open' aria-hidden='true'/>"
                                                    multiple>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="card">
                                            <div class="card-body">
                                                <h4 class="card-title"><span>已上傳檔案</span> <small class="text-muted">(點圖可放大或刪除)</small></h4>
                                                <div id="uploaded-ministry-of-education-eligibility-file-area">
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card my-3" id="ocac-eligibility-approval-area">
                                    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                                        僑委會
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <div class="row my-3">
                                            <div class="col-6">
                                                <label for="ocac-eligibility-approval-date">僑委會資格審查日期</label>
                                                <input class="form-control input-datepicker" data-provide="datepicker" data-date-format="yyyy/mm/dd" id="ocac-eligibility-approval-date">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-6">
                                                <label>僑委會資格審查文號</label>
                                                <input type="text" class="form-control" maxlength="191" id="ocac-eligibility-approval-doc-number">
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card hide my-3" id="upload-ocac-eligibility-file-area">
                                    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                                        僑委會資格審查公文掃描檔
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <div class="alert alert-warning">
                                            可接受副檔名為 <strong class="text-danger">pdf、jpg、png</strong> 的檔案，單一個檔案大小需 <strong class="text-danger">小於 8 Mbytes</strong> 。
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="row btn-upload" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                                            <div class="col-12">
                                                <input type="file" class="filestyle upload-ocac-eligibility-file-btn" id="upload-ocac-eligibility-file-btn"
                                                data-id="ocac-eligibility-file"
                                                data-btnClass="btn-success"
                                                data-input="false"
                                                data-text=" 選取檔案"
                                                data-Icon="<i class='fa fa-folder-open' aria-hidden='true'/>"
                                                multiple>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="card">
                                            <div class="card-body">
                                                <h4 class="card-title"><span>已上傳檔案</span> <small class="text-muted">(點圖可放大或刪除)</small></h4>
                                                <div id="uploaded-ocac-eligibility-file-area">
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card my-3" id="enrollment-announcement-area">
                                    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                                        錄取
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <div class="row my-3">
                                            <div class="col-6">
                                                <label for="enrollment-announcement-date">錄取公告日期</label>
                                                <input class="form-control input-datepicker" data-provide="datepicker" data-date-format="yyyy/mm/dd" id="enrollment-announcement-date">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-6">
                                                <label>錄取公告文號</label>
                                                <input type="text" class="form-control" maxlength="191" id="enrollment-announcement-doc-number">
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card hide my-3" id="upload-enrollment-announcement-file-area">
                                    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                                        錄取公告掃描檔
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <div class="alert alert-warning">
                                            可接受副檔名為 <strong class="text-danger">pdf、jpg、png</strong> 的檔案，單一個檔案大小需 <strong class="text-danger">小於 8 Mbytes</strong> 。
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="row btn-upload" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                                            <div class="col-12">
                                                <input type="file" class="filestyle upload-enrollment-announcement-file-btn" id="upload-enrollment-announcement-file-btn"
                                                data-id="enrollment-announcement-file"
                                                data-btnClass="btn-success"
                                                data-input="false"
                                                data-text=" 選取檔案"
                                                data-Icon="<i class='fa fa-folder-open' aria-hidden='true'/>"
                                                multiple>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="card">
                                            <div class="card-body">
                                                <h4 class="card-title"><span>已上傳檔案</span> <small class="text-muted">(點圖可放大或刪除)</small></h4>
                                                <div id="uploaded-enrollment-announcement-file-area">
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </form>
                        </div>
                            <!-- <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab2-tab"> -->
                                <!-- <p>這是 Tab 2 的內容。</p> -->
                            <!-- </div> -->
                        <!-- </div> -->
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal-footer">
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="save-enrollment-data-btn"><i class="fa fa-save" aria-hidden="true"></i> 儲存資料</button>
                        <button class="btn btn-success hide" id="apply-enrollment-data-btn"><i class="fa fa-send" aria-hidden="true"></i> 送出資料</button>
                        <button class="btn btn-danger hide" id="delete-enrollment-data-btn"><i class="fa fa-trash" aria-hidden="true"></i> 刪除資料</button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-sign-out" aria-hidden="true"></i> 離開</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="modal fade" id="student-data-modal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="student-data-title" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg" role="document">
                <div class="modal-content" id="modal-student-data">
                    <div class="modal-header">
                        <h5 id="student-data-modal-header"></h5>
                        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
                            <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal-body">
                        <form>
                            <div class="card my-3" id="studentArea">
                                <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                                    學生錄取資料
                                </div>
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <div class="row my-3">
                                        <div class="col-6">
                                            <label>系統編號</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" maxlength="191" id="user-id" disabled>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-6">
                                            <label>學生編號</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" maxlength="191" id="student-id" disabled>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row my-3">
                                        <div class="col-6">
                                            <label>姓名</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" maxlength="191" id="name" disabled>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-6">
                                            <label>身分別</label>
                                            <select class="form-control selectpicker" id="identity" data-style="btn-white" title="請選擇">
                                                <option value="1">港澳生</option>
                                                <option value="2">港澳具外國國籍之華裔學生</option>
                                                <option value="3">海外僑生</option>
                                            </select>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row my-3">
                                        <div class="col-12">
                                            <label">通報學校</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" maxlength="191" id="report-school">
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row my-3">
                                        <div class="col-12">
                                            <label">資格審定公文日期及文字號</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" maxlength="191" id="qualification-verified-approval-date-and-number">
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row my-3">
                                        <div class="col-6">
                                            <label>資格是否符合</label>
                                            <select class="form-control selectpicker" id="qualification-eligibility-status" data-style="btn-white" title="請選擇">
                                                <option value="資格符合">資格符合</option>
                                                <option value="資格不符">資格不符</option>
                                                <option value="審查資料不全">審查資料不全</option>
                                            </select>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-6">
                                            <label>是否錄取</label>
                                            <select class="form-control selectpicker" id="admission-decision" data-style="btn-white" title="請選擇">
                                                <!-- <option value="-1" selected disabled hidden>請選擇</option> -->
                                                <option value="Y">錄取</option>
                                                <option value="N">未錄取</option>
                                            </select>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row my-3">
                                        <div class="col-12">
                                            <label">錄取榜單日期及文字號</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" maxlength="191" id="admission-list-date-and-document-number">
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row my-3">
                                        <div class="col-6">
                                            <label>錄取學校</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" maxlength="191" id="admitted-school">
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-6">
                                            <label>錄取系所</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" maxlength="191" id="admitted-department">
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal-footer">
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="save-student-data-btn"><i class="fa fa-save" aria-hidden="true"></i> 儲存</button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-sign-out" aria-hidden="true"></i> 離開</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="modal fade" id="student-data-list-modal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="student-data-list-title" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="modal-dialog modal-xxl" role="document">
                <div class="modal-content" id="modal-student-data-list">
                    <div class="modal-header">
                        <h5 id="student-data-list-modal-header"></h5>
                        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
                            <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal-body">
                        <div class="col-md-5 col-6 text-right">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <input id="student-filter" class="form-control" type="text" placeholder="搜尋 報名序號、僑編、姓名、EMAIL">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <table id="student-list" class="table table-hover sortable">
                                    <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th data-defaultsign='nospan'></th>
                                        <th>報名序號</th>
                                        <th>僑生編號</th>
                                        <th>姓名</th>
                                        <th>性別</th>
                                        <th>Email</th>
                                        <th>班別</th>
                                        <th>身份別</th>
                                    </tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody>
                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
                                <div id="student-list-pagination-container"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal-footer">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-sign-out" aria-hidden="true"></i> 離開</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="modal fade img-modal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="img-modal" aria-hidden="true" id="img-modal">
	<div class="modal-dialog modal-lg">
		<div class="modal-content">
			<div class="modal-body text-center" id="img-modal-body">
				<img src="" class="img-fluid rounded img-ori">
			</div>
			<div class="modal-footer">
				<button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" id="delete-enrollment-data-file-btn"><i class="fa fa-trash" aria-hidden="true"></i> 刪除</button>
				<button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-sign-out" aria-hidden="true"></i> 離開</button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<script type="text/javascript" src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/bootstrap-filestyle/1.3.0/bootstrap-filestyle.min.js"> </script>